-- ฟังก์ชันระเบิดพื้นที่แบบเบาลง (ไม่ทำดาเมจกับตัวละครเราเอง)
local function detonateArea(position, radius, force, destroyBlocks)
	local exp = Instance.new("Explosion")
	exp.Position = position
	exp.BlastRadius = radius
	exp.BlastPressure = force
	exp.DestroyJointRadiusPercent = 0
	exp.Parent = workspace

	local myChar = LocalPlayer.Character
	local myHum = myChar and myChar:FindFirstChildOfClass("Humanoid")
	local prevHealth = myHum and myHum.Health

	local params = OverlapParams.new()
	params.FilterType = Enum.RaycastFilterType.Exclude
	if myChar then
		params.FilterDescendantsInstances = {myChar, aimRing}
	else
		params.FilterDescendantsInstances = {aimRing}
	end

	local parts = workspace:GetPartBoundsInRadius(position, radius, params)
	for _, part in ipairs(parts) do
		if part:IsA("BasePart") and not part.Locked and not isPlayerPart(part) then
			if destroyBlocks and part.Size.Magnitude < 45 then
				part.Anchored = false
				part:BreakJoints()
			end
		end
	end

	if myHum and prevHealth and myHum.Health < prevHealth then
		myHum.Health = prevHealth
	end
end

-- ฟังก์ชันฝนดาวตก
local function triggerMeteorShower()
	if isMeteorRunning then return end
	isMeteorRunning = true

	showBanner(MeteorBanner, 3)

	local endTime = os.clock() + 10
	task.spawn(function()
		while os.clock() < endTime do
			for _ = 1, 2 do
				local char = LocalPlayer.Character
				local root = char and char:FindFirstChild("HumanoidRootPart")
				if root then
					local spreadX = math.random(-75, 75)
					local spreadZ = math.random(-75, 75)
					local spawnPos = root.Position + Vector3.new(spreadX + math.random(-15, 15), 95, spreadZ + math.random(-15, 15))
					local fallDir = (Vector3.new(root.Position.X + spreadX, root.Position.Y - 25, root.Position.Z + spreadZ) - spawnPos).Unit

					local meteor = Instance.new("Part")
					meteor.Name = "Meteor_Part"
					meteor.Shape = Enum.PartType.Ball
					meteor.Size = Vector3.new(3, 3, 3)
					meteor.Material = Enum.Material.Neon
					meteor.Color = Color3.fromRGB(255, 105, 25)
					meteor.Position = spawnPos
					meteor.Anchored = true
					meteor.CanCollide = false
					meteor.Parent = workspace

					task.spawn(function()
						local speed = 95
						local maxLife = 3.5
						local elapsed = 0

						while meteor.Parent and elapsed < maxLife do
							local dt = RunService.RenderStepped:Wait()
							elapsed += dt

							local stepDist = speed * dt
							local rayParams = RaycastParams.new()
							rayParams.FilterType = Enum.RaycastFilterType.Exclude
							rayParams.FilterDescendantsInstances = {meteor, aimRing, LocalPlayer.Character}

							local hit = workspace:Raycast(meteor.Position, fallDir * (stepDist + 1.5), rayParams)
							if hit then
								meteor.Position = hit.Position
								detonateArea(hit.Position, 12, 180000, true)
								meteor:Destroy()
								break
							else
								meteor.Position += fallDir * stepDist
							end
						end

						if meteor.Parent then
							meteor:Destroy()
						end
					end)
				end
			end
			task.wait(0.22)
		end
		isMeteorRunning = false
	end)
end

-- ฟังก์ชันจุดเล็งและเสกซูเปอร์โนวา
local function getAimTargetPosition()
	local viewportCenter = Vector2.new(Camera.ViewportSize.X * 0.5, Camera.ViewportSize.Y * 0.5)
	local ray = Camera:ViewportPointToRay(viewportCenter.X, viewportCenter.Y)

	local rayParams = RaycastParams.new()
	rayParams.FilterType = Enum.RaycastFilterType.Exclude
	rayParams.FilterDescendantsInstances = {aimRing, LocalPlayer.Character}

	local result = workspace:Raycast(ray.Origin, ray.Direction * 900, rayParams)
	if result then
		return result.Position
	end
	return ray.Origin + ray.Direction * 220
end

local function triggerSupernova(targetPos)
	if isSupernovaRunning then return end
	isSupernovaRunning = true
	supernovaAimActive = false
	aimRing.Parent = nil

	showBanner(NovaBanner, 4)

	local originalCameraType = Camera.CameraType
	local originalCFrame = Camera.CFrame
	Camera.CameraType = Enum.CameraType.Scriptable

	local novaCore = Instance.new("Part")
	novaCore.Name = "Nova_Core"
	novaCore.Shape = Enum.PartType.Ball
	novaCore.Size = Vector3.new(4, 4, 4)
	novaCore.Material = Enum.Material.Neon
	novaCore.Color = Color3.fromRGB(130, 225, 255)
	novaCore.Position = targetPos + Vector3.new(0, 55, 0)
	novaCore.Anchored = true
	novaCore.CanCollide = false
	novaCore.Parent = workspace

	local shockwave = Instance.new("Part")
	shockwave.Name = "Nova_Wave"
	shockwave.Shape = Enum.PartType.Ball
	shockwave.Size = Vector3.new(6, 6, 6)
	shockwave.Material = Enum.Material.ForceField
	shockwave.Color = Color3.fromRGB(90, 200, 255)
	shockwave.Position = targetPos
	shockwave.Anchored = true
	shockwave.CanCollide = false
	shockwave.Transparency = 0.45
	shockwave.Parent = workspace

	task.spawn(function()
		local elapsed = 0
		local duration = 2.2
		while elapsed < duration do
			local dt = RunService.RenderStepped:Wait()
			elapsed += dt

			local progress = math.clamp(elapsed / duration, 0, 1)
			novaCore.Position = (targetPos + Vector3.new(0, 55, 0)):Lerp(targetPos, progress)
			novaCore.Size = Vector3.new(4, 4, 4) + Vector3.new(14, 14, 14) * progress

			local waveScale = 6 + (65 * progress)
			shockwave.Size = Vector3.new(waveScale, waveScale, waveScale)
			shockwave.Transparency = math.clamp(0.45 + progress * 0.5, 0, 1)

			local camPos = targetPos + Vector3.new(math.cos(elapsed * 1.2) * 65, 42, math.sin(elapsed * 1.2) * 65)
			local shake = Vector3.new(math.random(-1, 1), math.random(-1, 1), math.random(-1, 1)) * 0.15
			Camera.CFrame = CFrame.lookAt(camPos + shake, targetPos)
		end

		detonateArea(targetPos, 32, 450000, true)
		novaCore:Destroy()
		shockwave:Destroy()

		Camera.CameraType = originalCameraType
		Camera.CFrame = originalCFrame
		isSupernovaRunning = false
	end)
end

-- ฟังก์ชันย้อนเวลาเฉพาะวัตถุย้อนหลัง ~5 วินาที (ผู้เล่นและกล้องไม่โดนย้อน)
local function triggerRewindObjects()
	if isRewinding or #objectHistory == 0 then return end
	isRewinding = true

	showBanner(RewindBanner, 3)

	local now = os.clock()
	local targetTime = now - 5

	-- หาจุดบันทึกที่ใกล้เคียงช่วง 5 วินาทีก่อนหน้ามากที่สุด
	local bestIdx = 1
	local bestDiff = math.abs(objectHistory[1].t - targetTime)
	for i, entry in ipairs(objectHistory) do
		local diff = math.abs(entry.t - targetTime)
		if diff <= bestDiff then
			bestDiff = diff
			bestIdx = i
		end
	end

	-- ค่อยๆ เล่นย้อนจากปัจจุบันกลับไปจุด ~5 วินาทีก่อนหน้าเฉพาะชิ้นส่วนวัตถุ
	for i = #objectHistory, bestIdx, -1 do
		local snapMap = objectHistory[i].parts
		for part, data in pairs(snapMap) do
			if part and part.Parent and not isPlayerPart(part) then
				part.Anchored = true
				part.AssemblyLinearVelocity = Vector3.zero
				part.AssemblyAngularVelocity = Vector3.zero
				part.CFrame = part.CFrame:Lerp(data.cf, 0.55)
			end
		end
		RunService.RenderStepped:Wait()
	end

	-- ตั้งค่าตำแหน่งและสถานะ Anchored สุดท้ายให้ตรงกับจุด ~5 วินาทีก่อนหน้า
	local finalMap = objectHistory[bestIdx].parts
	for part, data in pairs(finalMap) do
		if part and part.Parent and not isPlayerPart(part) then
			part.AssemblyLinearVelocity = Vector3.zero
			part.AssemblyAngularVelocity = Vector3.zero
			part.CFrame = data.cf
			part.Anchored = data.anchored
		end
	end

	while #objectHistory >= bestIdx do
		table.remove(objectHistory)
	end

	isRewinding = false
end

